17. Executor Framework (🔥 ENTERPRISE MUST-KNOW)
Problem with Manual Threads
Resource exhaustion
Poor scalability

Executor Example
ExecutorService executor =
    Executors.newFixedThreadPool(2);

executor.submit(() -> System.out.println("Task"));
executor.shutdown();

Output
Task

18. Callable & Future
Callable<Integer> task = () -> 10;

ExecutorService ex = Executors.newSingleThreadExecutor();
Future<Integer> f = ex.submit(task);

System.out.println(f.get());
ex.shutdown();

Output
10

✔ Returns result
✔ Can throw exception

